MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

compiler/CheckedExceptions/parse: throws clauses on decls (functions, members,
ctors, prop accessors, main), functional types incl. single-type sugar and
nesting, negative cases pinned to the new diagnostics, and flag-off guards
(throws stays an identifier; clause syntax rejected).

compiler/CheckedExceptions/types: red-first cases for M2 — §3.4 set-based
functional subtyping, §3.7 overload duplicates, §3.8 override subsumption,
§3.6 generics (explicit args positive; no inference from capability lists).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
