--- /dev/null
+++ b/testsuites/LLT/compiler/CheckedExceptions/parse/neg_ellipsis_in_type.cj
@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+// Checked exceptions (§3.4/§6.3.5): the `...` marker never appears in functional
